  <ace_:TV_pl rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">are part of</ace_:TV_pl>
  <ace_:TV_sg rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">is part of</ace_:TV_sg>
  <ace_:TV_vbg rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">divided into parts</ace_:TV_vbg>
  <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">PartOf is a binary relation that is a partial ordering between abstract entities or between perdurants. It founds an extensional mereology on each of these two categories.</rdfs:comment>
