  <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">directQualityOf is a binary relation between a quality and the unique entity it inheres in, which is an endurant or a perdurant. It implies specific constant dependence.</rdfs:comment>
