  <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">aka immediate quale</rdfs:comment>
  <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">qualeOf is a binary relation between a temporal region and a temporal quality, relating the quality to its quale (position in the quality space).</rdfs:comment>
  <rdfs:label rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">quale of</rdfs:label>
