  <ace_:TV_vbg rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">divided into temporal parts</ace_:TV_vbg>
  <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">temporalPartOf is the specialisation of the partOf relation between two perdurants x and y, x being a temporal slice of y, that is, a maximal part of y during some time interval.</rdfs:comment>
