  <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A Perdurant is an entity that happens in time (examples: a person’s life, a soccer game, the reading of a book, the state of feeling happy). Some perdurants are temporally atomic (example: the change of a letter’s state due to the breaking of the seal).</rdfs:comment>
