  <ace_:CN_sg rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">endurant</ace_:CN_sg>
  <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">An Endurant is an entity wholly present, i.e., all its proper parts are present, at any time that it is present (examples: a person, a tree, an atom, an idea).</rdfs:comment>
