  <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">An Abstract Quality is a quality that directly inheres to a non-physical endurant (examples: the value of an asset, the rights of the UN general secretary).</rdfs:comment>
  <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Warning: Abstract qualities are not qualities of abstract entities, but of non-physical endurants</rdfs:comment>
